                            "description": {
                              "value": "You can hold a two-handed weapon in one hand without penalty due to the weapon's bulk, and holding non-weapon objects does not count as dual-wielding for you unless you use the object as a weapon. If you try to hold multiple weapons or use a non-weapon object as a weapon, the bulk of the items affects your ability to attack effectively as normal."
